From 09b1db20e81345566d24289531ccd434c52e5b87 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:12:45 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Draw the switcher with the game list's own column and open it
 from Extras
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The switcher now takes the theme's custom view «switcher» and binds its extras to the game
shown, as a game list binds its own to the selected game: a theme can give it the very column
of its game list. The view also places the picture, the line about the automatic save over it
and the pager, and it is not offered as a game list style. A new automatic collection,
«continue», holds the recent games and opens the switcher instead of a list; it is there
whenever the Canica kit is installed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
